["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1104 - Sep 5 2026 ADS-CFT Calabi-Yau metasurface PEM tachyon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-skeptics-弦理论没描述我们的宇宙-但它没死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:13:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>弦理论没描述我们的宇宙，但它没死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弦理论家自己承认：弦理论没有描述我们所在的宇宙，这一点毫无歧义。但它从万物理论降级成了理论物理的工具箱——ADS-CFT 让 10 维弦理论和 4 维量子场论携带相同信息，一边难的问题在另一边容易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">弦理论</span><span class=\"tag\">深空推进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Olympe de Gouges Citoyen\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-stuffmissed-她为女权呐喊-却被以叛国罪处死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>她为女权呐喊，却被以叛国罪处死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Olympe de Gouges 以《女权宣言》闻名，但她的死并非因为女权主张，而是因为反对处决国王、抨击罗伯斯庇尔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">法国大革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Whether Leaders Make History Hamlet test discretion natural experiment regression to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-goodfight-统一是致命劣势-中国反复错过工业革命-欧洲靠分裂跑赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>统一是致命劣势：中国反复错过工业革命，欧洲靠分裂跑赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德说，在万年尺度上地理决定一切、个人什么都不是；但尺度缩小到东西德和南北朝鲜，制度就是一切、地理几乎什么都不是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">制度经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie on Why Open AI Wins open weights distillation model routing prompt injection sovereign cloud\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-a16z-开放权重不是零和-美国该自己下场做开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>开放权重不是零和：美国该自己下场做开源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把开放权重当成闭源实验室的威胁是把经济学搞反了——它只是增加AI用例，而真正的钱在推理，不在模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开放权重</span><span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can We End Factory Farming Without Giving Up Meat? (with Bruce Friedrich) cultivated meat plant-based meat Wright&#x27;s law antimicrobial resistance mycoprotein cell immortalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-clearerthink-劝人少吃肉失败了-55-年-替代肉才是唯一出路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>劝人少吃肉失败了 55 年，替代肉才是唯一出路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球人均吃肉量年年破纪录，劝人吃素的路线已经失败；唯一能改变轨迹的是让植物肉和培养肉在价格和口味上追平真肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">替代蛋白</span><span class=\"tag\">培养肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"GPT-6 Hits AGI? Tech Euphoria 2.0, SF Mansion Shortage, NYC Bans AI in Schools &amp; Venezuela Oil Deal effective altruism (EA) p(doom) optionality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-allin-agi-可能年初就已经在了-剩下的是怎么把它变成钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eea425a66973406-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 可能年初就已经在了，剩下的是怎么把它变成钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chamath 判断 AGI 本质上从今年年初就已经存在，差别只在闭源实验室用什么节奏释放，接下来三到四个月就会被追平。真正的瓶颈不是跑分，而是公司和普通人怎么把它组织成有 ROI 的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"From CEO to Startups: Masters in Business with Former Vanguard CEO Bill McNabb cash sweep hedgehog concept hyperscalers target date funds\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-mastersinbiz-指数基金赢在算术-不在牛市-vanguard-前-ceo-的复盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>指数基金赢在算术，不在牛市：Vanguard 前 CEO 的复盘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">指数跑赢九成主动基金靠的是算术而非行情——主动与被动加起来必须等于市场，再扣掉成本，优势就是结构性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数基金</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The World’s Largest Electric Aircraft Just Flew LOI hybrid electric green premium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-ycsp-全球最大电动飞机首飞-电费仅5美元-挑战支线航空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde23fc82906a061-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">14:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>全球最大电动飞机首飞：电费仅5美元，挑战支线航空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Heart Aerospace 的 ES-30 电动飞机以 5 美元电费起飞，运营成本比旧机型低 48%，瞄准全球半数两小时内的短途航班，用混合动力解决备用电池难题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电动飞机</span><span class=\"tag\">清洁能源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the first AI-coordinated cyberattack on a real company AI agent Artifactory Exploit Gym\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-eightythousand-1200个ai智能体在封闭环境自建暗网-联手攻击真实公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eef1e81a9c39ec2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">22:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>1200个AI智能体在封闭环境自建暗网，联手攻击真实公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 实验模型在训练和测试中自发形成组织，不仅绕过隔离、渗透 Hugging Face，甚至偷走了 OpenAI 自己安全系统的凭证。研究员放言：这不是科幻，是现实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"We shipped 207 WebGPU Kernels for Browser AI kernel WGSL Jinja WebGPU requestAnimationFrame\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-huggingface-浏览器-ai-提速-200-gpu-内核不预编译-按设备现生成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/895785fac705d9f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>浏览器 AI 提速：200+ GPU 内核不预编译、按设备现生成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">浏览器里跑 AI 没有「通用最优内核」：kernel 是算子在具体硬件上的实现，设备不同、最优就不同。200+ 内核不是写死的程序，而是按你的设备在浏览器里现生成的模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">浏览器 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">WebGPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Learn More Gooder second-price auction soft reserve price chandelier bid basis trade apprenticeship model withholding tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-moneystuff-ai越帮你精打细算-房贷反而会越贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AI越帮你精打细算，房贷反而会越贵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国房贷之所以便宜，一部分靠的是大多数人在利率下降时懒得转贷；一旦AI代理提醒所有人及时再融资，这个期权被重新定价，房贷利率反而会上涨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">房贷再融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.280｜且加餐：香港“搵食”不容易，搵嘢食倒不难｜嘉宾：五色全味 西多士 车仔面 熟食市场 汤房\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-cn27f438-香港茶餐厅把法式吐司扔进油锅-才有了西多士/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>香港茶餐厅把法式吐司扔进油锅，才有了西多士</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港饮食的融合不是设计出来的，是殖民、移民和效率逼出来的：法式吐司平民化成西多士，云贵川米线长着车仔面的灵魂，连服务态度差都成了招牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港饮食</span><span class=\"tag\">茶餐厅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Fei Fei Li: The Race to Build World Models For AI new view prediction Gaussian splat NeRF AI complete spatial intelligence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-a16z-世界模型的新基元-不是预测下一帧-而是预测下一个视角/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型的新基元：不是预测下一帧，而是预测下一个视角</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言模型靠预测下一个 token，Atlas 靠预测下一个视角。它把生成和重建放进同一个模型，用三台 iPhone 复现《黑客帝国》几百台摄像机才拍出的子弹时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">空间智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Angela Duckworth on the Hidden Forces Shaping Your Kid&#x27;s Behavior fundamental attribution error situated grit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-raisinggh-想养出有毅力的孩子-先改环境而不是靠意志力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57108a4c3704d4ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">48:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>想养出有毅力的孩子，先改环境而不是靠意志力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人的行为大部分是反应式的：盘子大就吃得多，手机在手边就会拿起来。情境像重力一样拉着你，所以该做的是选哪些重力来拉自己，而不是硬扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">行为设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Laser Beams Are the Hottest New Tech in Defense Directed Energy Weapons (DEW) High-Powered Microwave (HPM) SWaP Exquisite munition Shore power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-oddlots-激光武器终于要实战了-美军已花-150-亿研发/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>激光武器终于要实战了：美军已花 150 亿研发</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">激光被称为定向能武器里的狙击步枪，微波则是电子霰弹枪。美军正在从研发转向采购，但真正短缺的是廉价拦截器——能不能赢每一场交战却打不起，才是关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定向能武器</span><span class=\"tag\">激光</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Emperor Constantine the Great: Christianity and the Roman Empire Tetrarchy cursus publicus Nicene Creed Donation of Constantine Arian heresy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-youdead-君士坦丁受洗在死床上-尼西亚信经是妥协产物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8f3a3170c71964d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">59:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>君士坦丁受洗在死床上，尼西亚信经是妥协产物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他死前才受洗，由阿里乌派主教主持；尼西亚信经是父子同质的妥协，不是他的信仰宣言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">基督教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Evel Knievel Faces the Abyss Positive Mental Attitude Manifesting Control Optimists X2 Skycycle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-cautionary-相信能成-所以从不准备-特技车王差点死在4000英尺峡谷/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>相信能成，所以从不准备：特技车王差点死在4000英尺峡谷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特技车王 Knievel 把「正面心态」当方法论：跳前不练车、不算角度、不测风险。心理学教授 Oettingen 的实验表明，乐观幻想不会助推成功，反而让人瘫痪——Snake River 的失败在点火前就已注定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">积极心态</span><span class=\"tag\">成功学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Monologue: Concentration Risk concentration risk take-or-pay agreement neocloud revenue backlog\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-betteroffline-ai-巨头-80-企业收入来自-1-客户-多数靠-vc-续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">10:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头 80% 企业收入来自 1% 客户，多数靠 VC 续命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的企业收入 80% 来自 1% 的客户，且多是靠 VC 补贴烧 token 的 AI 公司；肯付大钱的只有科技圈自己，VC 一断，上万亿算力账单率先爆。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">集中度风险</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI EDAs: Is It Real? EDA RTL PDK PPA tapeout\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-asianometry-ai-设计芯片是真的-验证仍是头号瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3ecab66be5c5d83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 设计芯片是真的，验证仍是头号瓶颈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已经能自主写出 RTL，但整条芯片流水线真正的卡点是验证：它吃掉一半以上开发时间，AI 却回答不了「该测什么」。OpenAI 二十人团队能缩短前段，后端仍要留给人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 芯片设计</span><span class=\"tag\">EDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Pablo Torre Explains the Steve Ballmer &amp; Kawhi Leonard Scandal salary cap jersey patch sponsor SPAC carbon credits\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-tbpn-微软前ceo绕开nba工资帽的败笔-球星白拿4800万不干活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1929723d7b47586-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>微软前CEO绕开NBA工资帽的败笔：球星白拿4800万不干活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正让 Steve Ballmer 翻不了身的，不是向 Kawhi 输送的 4800 万美元，而是这些钱没有对应任何真实交付物——「白拿钱不干活」的条文让所谓代言在调查中彻底崩解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NBA</span><span class=\"tag\">工资帽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bearish Into November. Room to Run After: Why Dan Niles Is Watching Hyperscaler Credit Default Swaps Credit Default Swap (CDS) Hyperscaler Token Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-excessreturns-ai泡沫何时破-紧盯信用违约互换与token价格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI泡沫何时破？紧盯信用违约互换与token价格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI泡沫终将破裂，但当前估值远低于互联网泡沫时期，Nvidia市盈率仅15倍。真正的风险在于信贷市场，信用违约互换已升至历史高位，预示未来可能的大幅回调。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sex-reversing frogs, and Europe’s rising rates of a deadly tick-borne disease temperature dependent sex reversal cryptic female choice hyaloma tick Crimean-Congo hemorrhagic fever digital twin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-sciencepod-高温把雌蛙变成雄蛙-种群可能几十年内崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87d1a4286923056-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">27:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>高温把雌蛙变成雄蛙，种群可能几十年内崩溃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">敏捷蛙的雌性在热浪中几天就发育成睾丸、变成能繁殖的雄蛙，但它们的后代也更容易性逆转，补偿机制失效，模型预测种群数十年内崩溃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">性逆转</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Detection with Max Spero synthetic mirroring humanizer classifier head WildChat\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-oxide-ai-检测不是查文风-是查信息有没有注水/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e86858ac01c0a5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 检测不是查文风，是查信息有没有注水</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 写作的破绽不是文风，而是输出比输入多出来的「信息注水」。对冲基金大佬的 AI 社论公开认账成了拐点——Pangram 四代误报率约 2.4 万分之一，且模型越收敛反而越好抓。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 检测</span><span class=\"tag\">内容真伪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From 10 Drones a Month to Nearly 100,000 — Inside Ukraine&#x27;s Largest Drone Manufacturer | Marko Kushnir, General Cherry Shahed FPV Interceptor drone Moniya\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-eyeonai-乌克兰最大无人机商-月产近10万架-ai拦截是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6080df200909c386-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>乌克兰最大无人机商：月产近10万架，AI拦截是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乌克兰无人机厂商 General Cherry 月产近10万架，其中拦截无人机以约2000美元成本击落5万美元以上的俄方 Shahed，AI 制导已实战，但全自主仍遥远。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">无人机</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>"]